The textures, models, sounds, language files, recipes, loot tables, tags and
advancements in content/ come from the original mod (tools/content.mjs builds
them from its checkout; the backpack models are merged from its model parts).
Some Russian lines were translated for this port.

This port, by DispatchedToHeaven, rewrites Traveler's Backpack's Java code in
Rust for Horizon's native mod API. It uses no code from LambDynamicLights: the
lantern lights through Horizon's own dynamic lights or Better Dynamic Lights.

